2026-07-27T11:53:46.4194422Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T11:53:46.4194988Z i /tmp/RtmpDP0SEM/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:53:46.4195377Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:53:46.4195833Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:53:46.4196383Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:53:46.4196975Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:53:46.4198231Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:53:46.4199052Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
